{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><div class=\"incontent\" id=\"blockcontent\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Article\">\n<div class=\"colleft mt-1\" id=\"date\">\n<p class=\"date\" itemprop=\"datePublished\">發布日期   2026年11月15日 16:19 星期日</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"upper\"><p>港澳辦公布，港澳辦主任夏寶龍今（15日）在深圳聽取「有關工作情况」匯報。港澳辦未有具體交代匯報涉及的事項。港澳辦分管日常工作的副主任徐啟方亦有參與。</p></div>\n<div id=\"lower\">\n<div class=\"articlelogin\"><p>港澳辦於去年12月1日大埔宏福苑大火後，亦曾發稿指夏寶龍在深圳聽取「有關情况」匯報。</p></div><p>相關字詞﹕夏寶龍 港澳辦 </p> </div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T08:58:05.120467+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":159,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T08:19:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T09:09:15.557525+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T08:52:00.687617+00:00","content_hash":"84747bdef00474b851db9d46291036756d6bc5d7ab61aba46b69309a9debcdc8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}